(7479582, 1189284, 155094, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dennisheckman:</b></div><hr/><i> This looks almost too perfect to be found in the natural world. Is it indoors? Either way, you did a great job capturing it. </i></td></tr></table>  This is a beautiful area where I stay, it is not on a pathway, you have to walk in the river to get to it.It was rainind with a breeze blowing. Camera was getting splashed by the water, but a lovely place to be. Thanks for you comment</td>', 'Originally posted by Dennisheckman: This looks almost too perfect to be found in the natural world. Is it indoors? Either way, you did a great job capturing it.   This is a beautiful area where I stay, it is not on a pathway, you have to walk in the river to get to it.It was rainind with a breeze blowing. Camera was getting splashed by the water, but a lovely place to be. Thanks for you comment', '2016-10-26 04:12:59.000000', NULL, 0),
