(7481854, 1189391, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cyrilda:</b></div><hr/><i> Love it! Great Job. I''ve thought of doing that but don''t  want to wreck my car. LOL </i></td></tr></table>Ha! I was in the passenger seat. haha</td>', 'Originally posted by Cyrilda: Love it! Great Job. I''ve thought of doing that but don''t  want to wreck my car. LOL Ha! I was in the passenger seat. haha', '2016-11-09 14:51:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483185, 1189443, 115814, '<td valign="top">This simple backlit image caught my attention. It''s was initially a combination of the light and shadow with lovely bokeh. Even though the main subject isn''t compelling on it''s own, the combination of light and color works well. THEN... the butterfly! A remarkable story of nature''s camouflage, and I like it even better.</td>', 'This simple backlit image caught my attention. It''s was initially a combination of the light and shadow with lovely bokeh. Even though the main subject isn''t compelling on it''s own, the combination of light and color works well. THEN... the butterfly! A remarkable story of nature''s camouflage, and I like it even better.', '2016-11-19 00:43:46.000000', NULL, 0);
